      o              IS AN `An outcome`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a death deemed by VI.11` `the contract` o IF
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `disappearance` declared concluded THEN
            `the contract carries` `the disappearance extension` `the contract`
        AND declared
        AND concluded
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- The clause states no time for repaying, so the duty carries no WITHIN.
