`VI.11 the payees' undertaking to repay if the insured is found alive` MEANS
    PARTY `the insured person or their heir`
    MUST  `repay the death benefit`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the insured person or their heir` BECAUSE "the death benefit was not repaid after the insured was found alive (VI.11)"

